<div role="region" aria-label="Long description for right triangle upper Q upper R upper S" class="sr-only"><ul><li>Angle upper R is a right angle.</li>
<li>The length of side upper R upper S is 18.</li>
<li>A note indicates the figure is not drawn to scale.</li>
</ul></div></figure></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">In triangle <math alttext="upper Q upper R upper S"><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></math> shown, <math alttext="upper Q upper R less than upper R upper S"><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></math>. Which expression represents the length of <math alttext="line segment upper Q upper S"><mover><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></math>?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"bb5cb995-3620-4a77-9bc2-f243d28713ed","content":"<p><math alttext=\"18 cosine upper Q\"><mn>18</mn><mi>cos</mi><mi>Q</mi></math></p>"},{"id":"140c2c48-2992-42d2-9a1a-29643dc73eb2","content":"<p><math alttext=\"18 sine upper Q\"><mn>18</mn><mi>sin</mi><mi>Q</mi></math></p>"},{"id":"62596835-e9ab-40fd-bab9-9e9eeb3d2258","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 18 Over cosine upper Q EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"},{"id":"d2105737-7034-498a-9663-2fce311dc9a6","content":"<p><math alttext=\"StartFraction 18 Over sine upper Q EndFraction\"><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["D"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["d2105737-7034-498a-9663-2fce311dc9a6"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p>Choice D is correct. The figure shows that triangle <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="upper Q upper R upper S"><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></math> is a right triangle. Each of the given choices is an expression containing&nbsp;<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="sine upper Q"><mi>sin</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> or <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="cosine upper Q"><mi>cos</mi><mi>Q</mi></math>. For an acute angle in a right triangle, the sine of the angle is the length of the opposite leg divided by the length of the hypotenuse, and the cosine of the angle is the length of the adjacent leg divided by the length of the hypotenuse. It follows that <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="sine upper Q equals StartFraction upper R upper S Over upper Q upper S EndFraction"><mi>sin</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="cosine upper Q equals StartFraction upper Q upper R Over upper Q upper S EndFraction"><mi>cos</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>, where <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="upper Q upper R less than upper R upper S"><mi>Q</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></math>. It's given in the figure that the length of side <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="upper R upper S"><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></math> is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="18"><mn>18</mn></math>. Since only the equation <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="sine upper Q equals StartFraction upper R upper S Over upper Q upper S EndFraction"><mi>sin</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> contains <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="upper R upper S"><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></math>, an expression representing <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="upper Q upper S"><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi></math> can be found by substituting <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="18"><mn>18</mn></math> for <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="upper R upper S"><mi>R</mi><mi>S</mi></math> in this equation, which yields <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="sine upper Q equals StartFraction 18 Over upper Q upper S EndFraction"><mi>sin</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>. Multiplying both sides of this equation by <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="upper Q upper S"><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi></math> yields <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="upper Q upper S dot sine upper Q equals 18"><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math>. Dividing both sides of this equation by <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="sine upper Q"><mi>sin</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> yields <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="upper Q upper S equals StartFraction 18 Over sine upper Q EndFraction"><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>. Therefore, the expression <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="StartFraction 18 Over sine upper Q EndFraction"><mfrac><mn>18</mn><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> represents the length of <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="line segment upper Q upper S"><menclose notation="top"><mi>Q</mi><mi>S</mi></menclose></math>.</p>
<p>Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>
<p>Choice B is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>
<p>Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"94f7c9e2","external_id":"60ba6bab-7d16-46f1-9882-e80e2dd3577c","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"4d07420c-53ed-4755-aff0-a4ef8e622b41","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"S","domain":"Geometry and Trigonometry","skill_cd":"S.C.","skill_desc":"Right triangles and trigonometry","difficulty":"H","score_band_range_cd":6,"type":"mcq","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"250.0pt\" viewBox=\"0 0 250.0 210.0\" height=\"210.0pt\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Right triangle upper Q upper R upper S. Refer to long description.\">\n  <g>\n    <g><defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 200.239875  L 244.8 200.239875  L 244.8 -0  L 0 -0  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n   <g id=\"patch_2\">\n    <path d=\"M 7.2 190.368  L 237.6 190.368  L 237.6 7.2  L 7.2 7.2  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n   </g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_1\"></g>\n   <g id=\"matplotlib.axis_2\"></g>\n   <g id=\"text_1\">\n    <!-- $18$ -->\n    <defs>\n     <path d=\"M 39.40625 0  L 11.796875 0  L 11.796875 1.5  Q 17.296875 1.796875 19.296875 3.546875  Q 21.296875 5.296875 21.296875 9.5  L 21.296875 54.40625  Q 21.296875 59.296875 18.296875 59.296875  Q 16.90625 59.296875 13.796875 58.09375  L 11.09375 57.09375  L 11.09375 58.5  L 29 67.59375  L 29.90625 67.296875  L 29.90625 7.59375  Q 29.90625 4.296875 31.90625 2.890625  Q 33.90625 1.5 39.40625 1.5  z \" id=\"STIXGeneral-Regular-49\"></path>\n     <path d=\"M 44.5 15.5  Q 44.5 7.796875 39.140625 3.1875  Q 33.796875 -1