<div role="region" aria-label="Long description for right triangle" class="sr-only"><ul><li>One angle is a right angle.&nbsp;</li><li>The measure of a second angle is x°.&nbsp;</li><li>The lengths of the 2 sides adjacent to the right angle are as follows:&nbsp;<br><ul><li>15</li><li>15</li></ul></li><li>Note: Figure not drawn to scale.&nbsp;</li></ul></div></figure></p>
<p>In the triangle shown, what is the value of <math alttext="x"><mi>x</mi>
</math>?</p>$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$["45"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["45"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The correct answer is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="45"><mn>45</mn></math>. An isosceles right triangle has a right angle and two legs of equal length. In the triangle shown, one angle is a right angle and the two legs each have a length of <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="15"><mn>15</mn></math>. Thus, the given triangle is an isosceles right triangle. In an isosceles right triangle, the measures of the two non-right angles are <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="45 degree"><mn>45</mn><mo>°</mo></math>. It follows that the value of <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="x"><mi>x</mi></math> is <math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="45"><mn>45</mn></math>.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"9823f279","external_id":"2ea4a48a-1af7-4130-bdcd-0c54f14d34be","disclosed_item_id":null,"source":"qbank","vaultid":null,"uId":"8d4ff549-eca9-4b1a-af6b-e2f789bc4b7c","program":"SAT","test_type":2,"test_type_desc":"Math","primary_class_cd":"S","domain":"Geometry and Trigonometry","skill_cd":"S.C.","skill_desc":"Right triangles and trigonometry","difficulty":"M","score_band_range_cd":4,"type":"spr","stimulus":null,"stem":"<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><figure class='image'><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"250.0pt\" viewBox=\"0 0 250.0 210.0\" height=\"210.0pt\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"A right triangle. Refer to long description.\">\n  <g>\n    <g><defs>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n*{stroke-linecap:butt;stroke-linejoin:round;}\n  </style>\n </defs>\n <g id=\"figure_1\">\n  <g id=\"patch_1\">\n   <path d=\"M 0 200.239875  L 244.8 200.239875  L 244.8 -0  L 0 -0  z \" style=\"fill:none;\"></path>\n  </g>\n  <g id=\"axes_1\">\n