    ($SATQ$9acd101f$SATQ$, $SATQ$a786b147-72b1-4d1e-b373-354a8186f3a8$SATQ$::uuid, $SATQ$a487ac89-e969-4003-8a03-904dc08a17e6$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 2, $SATQ$Math$SATQ$, $SATQ$Geometry and Trigonometry$SATQ$, $SATQ$S$SATQ$, $SATQ$S.D.$SATQ$, $SATQ$Circles$SATQ$, $SATQ$H$SATQ$, 7, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, NULL, $SATQ$<p style="text-align: left;">The equation <math alttext="x squared plus left parenthesis y minus 1 right parenthesis squared equals 49"><mrow>
	<mrow>
		<msup>
			<mi>x</mi>
